 * The module boundary is established, but compressor, limiter, and gate
 * implementations are planned. Existing Analysis::EnvelopeFollower remains
 * an analysis utility until a separately approved API migration.
 *
 * Dynamics processors differ from filters: their effective gain may depend on
 * measured input level, so they are generally nonlinear and time-varying.
 */
